OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed over fatal Christmas
OL,4,AEve punch attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who fatally injured a 72-year-old
OL,7,Fman when he assaulted him on the
OL,8,Fdoorstep of his home has been jailed
OL,9,Ffor his manslaughter.
OL,11,FStephen Jedynak died in Pinderfields
OL,12,FHospital on 27 December after being
OL,13,Ffound unresponsive at his home in
OL,14,FThorntree Court, in the Crofton area of
OL,15,FWakefield, on Christmas Eve.
OL,17,FHis attacker, Hamza Shafique, 28 and
OL,18,Fformerly of Maidstone Street, Bradford,
OL,19,Fwas jailed for six years and three
OL,20,Fmonths at Leeds Crown Court on Monday
OL,21,Fafter pleading guilty to manslaughter.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
